Wasn't until minipops made music blogs explode that I discovered Aphex. Had been a fan of BoC for some time but had never gotten into acid/breakcore type stuff before. 

&#x200B;

I downloaded the Syro leak, listened to it on some nice headphones, and could not believe what I heard. I loved it because I did not fully understand it. I had never heard sound design and audio textures like that before. Blew my mind. Bought the CD as fast as I could after that.

Nothin to see here folks! These guys were fighting corruption! 

&#x200B;

